    {
      "title": "草稿及发布采样是否截断",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "1 表示达到上限；总览存量是下限，请进入对应链路排查。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
